  "description": "After stealing from a client in a bid to escape a dark past of debt and degradation, Yu-il seeks refuge in a distant countryside, only to fall for the enigmatic local priest, Kwon Mujin. Yu-il believes he has finally found a safe haven…until his peace shatters the night he stumbles upon the priest’s secret tryst. Caught spying and unable to hide his own arousal, Yu-il is subjected to Mujin’s sadistically lewd punishment. Stripped of his defenses, the young fugitive is forced to expose his innermost desires as if laying them bare in confession. But unbeknownst to Yu-il, the holy man conceals an ominous secret—one that threatens to drag him deep into an abyss where sanctity bleeds into a truly holy vice.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
